{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/c9c26573bcd2b4b44b8787167c6fe1d5.poster.avif?t=1774235087\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/c9c26573bcd2b4b44b8787167c6fe1d5.webm?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/c9c26573bcd2b4b44b8787167c6fe1d5.mp4?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You're Invited!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind the Masks</strong> is a free-for-all social deduction game, where you must try to keep your role concealed while exposing others. Leverage your role's abilities alongside your smarts to outwit opponents and become the last mask standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for up to 15 players, with full support for solo play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>= THE GAME =</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>Dances</strong> and <strong>Duels</strong> to earn prizes\u2014and make your opponents eligible for execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/73acbcf9204392bb69c25c4e51053528.poster.avif?t=1774235087\" width=422 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/73acbcf9204392bb69c25c4e51053528.webm?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/73acbcf9204392bb69c25c4e51053528.mp4?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduce</strong>\u00a0your opponents' roles, and strategically eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/afa8d699bdeb8224d125a959e50d173b.poster.avif?t=1774235087\" width=422 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/afa8d699bdeb8224d125a959e50d173b.webm?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/extras/afa8d699bdeb8224d125a959e50d173b.mp4?t=1774235087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>= FEATURES =</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely Unique Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Diverse Roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and Multiplayer Modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882100?t=1774235087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882100?t=1774235087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/93e01a8fc80ca2a278ee5d66749d7926ef6add58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774235087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882100/93e01a8fc80ca2a278ee5d66749d7926ef6add58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774235087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":